<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1463501525"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:32.000"><div begin="19.869" end="50.543" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="19.869" end="25.513" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.869" end="20.165">徘</span><span begin="20.165" end="20.493">徊</span><span begin="20.493" end="20.807">徬</span><span begin="20.807" end="21.148">徨</span><span begin="21.148" end="21.429">路</span><span begin="21.429" end="22.397">前</span> <span begin="22.702" end="23.139">回</span><span begin="23.139" end="23.529">望</span><span begin="23.529" end="23.849">这</span><span begin="23.849" end="24.301">一</span><span begin="24.301" end="25.513">段</span></p><p begin="28.326" end="33.989" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.326" end="28.648">你</span><span begin="28.648" end="28.973">吻</span><span begin="28.973" end="29.272">过</span><span begin="29.272" end="29.564">我</span><span begin="29.564" end="29.863">的</span><span begin="29.863" end="30.693">脸</span> <span begin="31.045" end="31.490">曾</span><span begin="31.490" end="31.823">是</span><span begin="31.823" end="32.177">百</span><span begin="32.177" end="32.621">千</span><span begin="32.621" end="33.989">遍</span></p><p begin="35.753" end="39.288" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.753" end="36.102">没</span><span begin="36.102" end="36.379">去</span><span begin="36.379" end="37.009">想</span><span begin="37.488" end="37.786">终</span><span begin="37.786" end="38.062">有</span><span begin="38.062" end="38.342">一</span><span begin="38.342" end="39.288">天</span></p><p begin="40.034" end="43.900" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.034" end="40.361">夜</span><span begin="40.361" end="40.692">雨</span><span begin="40.692" end="41.480">中</span><span begin="41.716" end="42.052">找</span><span begin="42.052" end="42.454">不</span><span begin="42.454" end="42.809">到</span><span begin="42.809" end="43.235">打</span><span begin="43.235" end="43.900">算</span></p><p begin="44.211" end="50.543" itu